{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t7STydg1kM1795063312.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>巴基斯坦成功試射「法塔赫-3型」超音速巡航導彈。</p><p></p><p>巴基斯坦軍方周三發表聲明，指「法塔赫-3型」超音速巡航導彈配備先進導航及推進系統，能夠對遠距離目標實施高精準度的強力打擊。是次成功試射將顯著提升陸軍火箭部隊司令部的作戰靈活度以及打擊範圍。</p><p></p><p>巴基斯坦總統、總理、陸軍參謀長等人祝賀導彈成功試射。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:59.062885+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:15.267205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:17.040435+00:00","content_hash":"d279caf815e62243834cb9c9f1e8a6cd7a24d39e174edef17728b5926fbb563a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:59.062885+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}